---

### How to put everything on GitHub

1. Create repo → `Abel-MD`
2. Click **Add file → Create new file**
3. Create each file one by one (for folders type `lib/client.js`, `plugins/main.js`, `public/index.html` etc.)
4. Or upload a zip of the whole folder

After all files are uploaded, go to any host (Railway / Render / Koyeb) and deploy from the repo.

Tell me when the repo is live and I will help you add more commands (sticker, download, group management, etc.).